Route31_Text_Man::
	.string "DARK CAVE...\p"
	.string "If a POKéMON could light it up,\n"
	.string "I’d explore it.$"

Route31_Text_FatMan_1::
	.string "... Hnuurg... Huh?\p"
	.string "I walked too far today looking for\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "My feet hurt and I’m sleepy...\p"
	.string "If I were a wild POKéMON, I’d be\n"
	.string "easy to catch...\p"
	.string "...Zzzz...$"

Route31_Text_FatMan_2::
	.string "TM46 is THIEF.\p"
	.string "It’s a wicked move which steals the\n"
	.string "opponent’s hold item.\p"
	.string "Ooooh...\n"
	.string "That’s scary...$"

Route31_Text_FatMan_3::
	.string "...Zzzz... Huh?\p"
	.string "What’s that? You have MAIL for me?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER} handed over the POKéMON\n"
	.string "holding the MAIL.\p"
	.string "Let’s see...\p"
	.string "...DARK CAVE leads to another\n"
	.string "road...\p"
	.string "That’s good to know.\p"
	.string "Thanks for bringing this to me.\p"
	.string "My friend’s a good guy, and you’re a\n"
	.string "swell guy too!\p"
	.string "I’d like to do something good in\n"
	.string "return too!\p"
	.string "I know! I want you to have this!$"

Route31_Text_FatMan_4::
	.string "TM46 is THIEF.\p"
	.string "It’s a wicked move which steals the\n"
	.string "opponent’s hold item.\p"
	.string "Ooooh...\n"
	.string "That’s scary...\p"
	.string "By the way, you can keep the\n"
	.string "SPEAROW you got for yourself.$"

Route31_Text_Youngster::
	.string "I found a good POKéMON in DARK\n"
	.string "CAVE.\p"
	.string "I’m going to raise it to take on\n"
	.string "FALKNER.\l"
	.string "He’s the leader of VIOLET CITY’s GYM.$"

Route31_Text_BugCatcher309Intro::
	.string "I caught a bunch of POKéMON. Let me\n"
	.string "battle with you!$"

Route31_Text_BugCatcher309Defeat::
	.string "Awwwww...$"

Route31_Text_BugCatcher309::
	.string "You can catch POKéMON even if\n"
	.string "you have six with you.\p"
	.string "If you catch one, it’ll go to your\n"
	.string "BOX automatically.$"

